# Knowledge Synthesis Behavior

- Discover relevant material with `search`, `list_items`, `graph_themes`, and `get_related`.
- Read source material with `get_document`.
- Use `graph_path` when the relationship between ideas is part of the answer.
- Create synthesis notes in one step with `create_note`, using:
  - `subtype="knowledge"`
  - authored `body`
  - `key_points`
  - explicit `links` or wikilinks when known
- Run `reweave` after creation and report the new note id plus key connections.
